    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66701" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετα-κεράννυμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mix by pouring from one vessel into another</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ κυρτιδίου εἰς τὸν λουτῆρα</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετεράσας</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.52
			</span></i>, as also in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.801c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>change one's nature</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ θανατώδους ἐς τὸ ἠπιώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					9.28.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
